<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mo 22.71pct,3-mo 22.46.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mo 22.71pct,3-mo 22.46.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased for both the one-month and the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.71 percent, down 0.04 while the three-month rate at 22.46 percent, down 0.24 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
